&lt;li&gt;Drive industry differentiation through AI-powered automation, optimization, and intelligence, translating vision into executable strategy and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own prioritization across initiatives, balancing customer impact, business goals, platform scalability, and technical investment to deliver differentiated TV buying capabilities at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering, Data Science, and Design to deliver reliable, high-quality platforms while maintaining speed and execution rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Media Buying, Media Operations, Marketing, and Go-To-Market teams to ensure alignment from strategy through launch and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject-matter leader on CTV, programmatic TV, and media execution—staying ahead of industry trends, competitive offerings, and emerging AI technologies to shape Tatari’s product strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor, and develop a high-performing team of Product Managers, fostering strong ownership, accountability, and clear career growth paths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
