&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management experience in AdTech, with deep expertise in streaming and programmatic CTV advertising; linear TV experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in programmatic platforms (DSPs), media execution, and advertising operations, with the ability to translate complex workflows into scalable products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of people management experience leading Product Managers, with a proven record of developing talent, improving team effectiveness, and delivering results through others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading cross-functional initiatives across engineering, data science, design, and media operations teams with diverse skill sets and seniority levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator and influencer, capable of articulating product vision and roadmap tradeoffs to senior leadership, partners, and customers with clarity and conviction&lt;/li&gt;
