&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring two Programmatic Media Managers: one focused on Direct Brands and one focused on Agency partners. As a Programmatic Media Manager, you will own performance outcomes for Streaming TV and OLV campaigns across your portfolio of clients/agencies. You’ll bring strong programmatic fundamentals and analytic thinking to help clients scale their campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Brands:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage a broader portfolio, with a heavier focus on hands-on trading, campaign activation, optimization, and performance analysis. You’ll work directly with clients alongside a dedicated Client Services owner, while spending the majority of your time driving campaign performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency&lt;/strong&gt;: Manage a smaller portfolio of agency partners and serve as the sole day-to-day owner of those relationships - there is no separate Client Services owner. You’ll own both hands-on programmatic campaign management and the client relationship, including performance conversations, strategic recommendations, and identifying opportunities to grow the partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Streaming TV and OLV campaigns end-to-end, from planning and activation through optimization, analysis, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take accountability for pacing, KPIs, and overall campaign performance, including proactive issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn performance data into clear, actionable optimization and scaling recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients to explain performance, insights, and recommendations; Direct Brands partners with a dedicated Client Services owner, while Agency owns the relationship directly&lt;/li&gt;
